  "level": 0,
  "ordinal": 0,
  "summary": "Main\nBulkers\nValues held broadly stable this week, with clean sales clustering close to VV Value across sizes, and the 15-year-old 60kDWT Supramax benchmark firming 1.9% as buyer appetite for midage Japanese-built Ultramax tonnage picked up notably. Capesize Attikos (178,900 DWT, 2012, HSG Sungdong) sold SS/DD Due by Capital Axis Maritime for USD 37 mil, VV Value USD 38.0 mil. Kamsarmax Mont Fort (82,300 DWT, 2012, Tsuneishi Zosen) sold to Greek buyers for USD 22 mil, VV Value USD 22.1 mil.",
